   "description": "<div><b><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 18.6667px\">User Story:</span></b><br></div><h3><a name=\"_Toc172501237\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\">As a</span></span></b><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"> system\nadministrator,</span><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"><br></span><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"> </span><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif\"><b><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\">I want </span></b><span style=\"font-weight: normal\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\">to</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: normal\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"> be able to manage\nparties (add, update, delete and so on) like add party, party type, set access\nrole, or suspend.</span></span><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"><br></span><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"> </span><b><span class=\"font\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\">so that</span></span></b><span style=\"font-weight: normal\"><span class=\"size\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"> I can manage permission\nand access control effectively.</span></span></a></h3><div><br></div><div><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b><br></div><p style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px\"><span style=\"\">1.<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><b>Admin portal:</b><br></p><ol><ul><li style=\"\">The system supports\n      the creation and management of parties.<br></li><li style=\"\">The system allows\n      viewing a list of all existing parties’ and party types.<br></li></ul></ol><p style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px\"><span style=\"\">2.<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><b>Party Types:</b><br></p><ol><ul><li style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>Provider<br></li><li style=\"\">User<br></li><li style=\"\">Merchant<br></li><li style=\"\">Agent<br></li></ul></ol><p style=\"margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px\"><span style=\"\">3.<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><b>Access control:</b><br></p><ol><ul><li style=\"\">The system\n      administrator can set specific roles for each party.<br></li><li style=\"\">The admin may be able to\n      suspend/unsuspend party.<br></li></ul></ol><div><br></div>",
